# Boot to the main menu from a profile with no progress (coord-firstboot): follows the pages instead of the clock.
# Prenarrative and intro end on CROSS; the title screen takes CROSS; then mainmenu.gum is up (Campaign highlighted).
wait preintro.gum 90
sleep 1
key X
wait intro.gum
sleep 1
key X
wait titlescreen.gum
sleep 1
key X
wait mainmenu.gum
sleep 3
mark main menu
